From eab066aab2e8a9842d8fafbff98c17914ec7c4ee Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Horizon authors <>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 07:45:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Care rules as data, the rest: scold and praise, refusing an
 item, the clamps of happiness, discipline, tiredness and weight, how long
 babies stay awake and how often they get hungry, what a night's sleep costs
 and gives back, feeding, the toilet, poop (wild, weight, eating it in three
 sizes), skipping hours, what a fight does to the partner and how long it
 takes (MOD_CARE grows to 137 slots, per-species overridable)

